usage: completion_gate.py [-h] {verify,authorize} ...

manifest-driven 3-state completion gate (runtime-ready | evidence-complete |
promotion-ready)

positional arguments:
  {verify,authorize}
    verify            evaluate a work-manifest and print a completion-manifest
                      JSON to stdout
    authorize         decide whether ONE side-effect action is authorized for
                      a work-manifest

options:
  -h, --help          show this help message and exit

exit codes: 0=success(promotion-eligible) 1=policy-block 2=invalid-input
